    "duration": 8.479,
    "offset": 27.76,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; I am getting hungry too. Can we eat now?",
    "duration": 8.161,
    "offset": 31.359,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Okay, let&#39;s make dinner. What should we",
