  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Watch me slice it.",
    "duration": 3.879,
    "offset": 488.16,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Wow, look at the cheese.",
    "duration": 6.04,
    "offset": 492.879,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "So stretchy.",
    "duration": 3.32,
    "offset": 495.599,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "M.",
    "duration": 6,
    "offset": 500.08,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "It is so crunchy and yummy.",
    "duration": 5.84,
    "offset": 501.84,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; M.",
    "duration": 5.36,
    "offset": 506.08,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "And the sauce is not sour anymore. It is",
    "duration": 4.96,
    "offset": 507.68,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "perfect.",
    "duration": 3.2,
    "offset": 511.44,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; This homemade pizza is better than",
    "duration": 5,
    "offset": 512.64,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "delivery.",
    "duration": 3,
    "offset": 514.64,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Do you know why it tastes so good?",
    "duration": 5.68,
    "offset": 518.32,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Why, Mom?",
    "duration": 5.04,
    "offset": 522,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Because we made it together.",
    "duration": 5.279,
    "offset": 524,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Food tastes better when we cook",
    "duration": 4.32,
    "offset": 527.04,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "together.",
    "duration": 4.56,
    "offset": 529.279,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Everyone, remember to help your parents",
    "duration": 5.72,
    "offset": 531.36,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "with housework.",
    "duration": 3.241,
    "offset": 533.839,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Hurry up, guys. Look at the time. We&#39;re",
    "duration": 4.16,
    "offset": 537.2,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "late.",
    "duration": 4.72,
    "offset": 539.76,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Wait for me, Dad. I can&#39;t find my other",
    "duration": 8.32,
    "offset": 541.36,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "saw. Mom, my backpack is so heavy today.",
    "duration": 7.84,
    "offset": 544.48,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; You are strong, Maya. Have a good art",
    "duration": 3.76,
    "offset": 549.68,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "class.",
    "duration": 5.24,
    "offset": 552.32,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Thanks, Mom. Bye.",
    "duration": 4.12,
    "offset": 553.44,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Goodbye.",
    "duration": 3.76,
    "offset": 558.32,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Work hard, Ethan.",
    "duration": 7.239,
    "offset": 560.16,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Thanks, honey. Enjoy your day off. Bye.",
    "duration": 5.319,
    "offset": 562.08,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Finally.",
    "duration": 6.24,
    "offset": 568.56,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Silence. Everyone is out. Just me and my",
    "duration": 6.841,
    "offset": 570.959,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "holiday.",
    "duration": 3,
    "offset": 574.8,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Oh, the screen is black.",
    "duration": 8.799,
    "offset": 582.72,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe it needs to charge. 1 2 3.",
    "duration": 7.041,
    "offset": 586.399,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Still nothing.",
    "duration": 7.32,
    "offset": 591.519,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Oh no, it is completely dead.",
    "duration": 5.399,
    "offset": 593.44,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Oh no, no phone, no news, no Facebook.",
    "duration": 8.32,
    "offset": 598.88,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "What do I do now? But look,",
    "duration": 6,
    "offset": 603.76,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "the sun is shining.",
    "duration": 6.52,
    "offset": 607.2,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "The sky is blue.",
    "duration": 3.96,
    "offset": 609.76,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Who needs a phone? I&#39;m going out.",
    "duration": 5.241,
    "offset": 614.079,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Usually I rush to work. I always look at",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "offset": 622.8,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "my phone.",
    "duration": 6.159,
    "offset": 625.68,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "But today I am walking slowly. It&#39;s so",
    "duration": 7.52,
    "offset": 627.2,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "quiet without the notifications. I can",
    "duration": 6.161,
    "offset": 631.839,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "finally hear the wind. Whoosh! It sounds",
    "duration": 7.52,
    "offset": 634.72,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "like music. The trees are very tall. The",
    "duration": 7.2,
    "offset": 638,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "leaves are dancing in the wind. It is",
    "duration": 4.88,
    "offset": 642.24,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "beautiful.",
    "duration": 3.84,
    "offset": 645.2,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "M.",
    "duration": 4.48,
    "offset": 647.12,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Something smells delicious.",
    "duration": 7.239,
    "offset": 649.04,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Is that fresh bread?",
    "duration": 4.679,
    "offset": 651.6,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Good morning, Grace.",
    "duration": 5.199,
    "offset": 656.32,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Good morning. One croissant, please.",
    "duration": 9.24,
    "offset": 657.839,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Here you go. Enjoy it while it&#39;s hot.",
    "duration": 5.56,
    "offset": 661.519,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Wow, so crispy.",
    "duration": 8.76,
    "offset": 667.44,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Oh, a bookstore. Let&#39;s go in.",
    "duration": 5.32,
    "offset": 670.88,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "This bookstore is so quiet.",
    "duration": 4.839,
    "offset": 676.24,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "I love the smell of old books.",
    "duration": 7.639,
    "offset": 683.2,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Yes.",
    "duration": 3,
    "offset": 687.839,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; It smells like history, doesn&#39;t it?",
    "duration": 6.8,
    "offset": 691.2,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; And the paper. It feels so real. No blue",
    "duration": 6.481,
    "offset": 693.839,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "light like a phone screen.",
    "duration": 4.8,
    "offset": 698,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Reading a real book is good for your",
    "duration": 4.079,
    "offset": 700.32,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "eyes",
    "duration": 3.44,
    "offset": 702.8,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "and your soul.",
    "duration": 6.56,
    "offset": 704.399,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; You are right. I will take this one.",
    "duration": 6.24,
    "offset": 706.24,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Wow,",
    "duration": 5.401,
    "offset": 710.959,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "look at these flowers.",
    "duration": 3.88,
    "offset": 712.48,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Do you want to buy some flowers?",
    "duration": 7.36,
    "offset": 716.56,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Yes, please. They look so fresh.",
    "duration": 6.639,
    "offset": 719.2,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "I want to bring some nature home for my",
    "duration": 4.919,
    "offset": 723.92,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "family.",
    "duration": 3,
    "offset": 725.839,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "I am so tired. My feet hurt.",
    "duration": 6.88,
    "offset": 735.36,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Grace,",
    "duration": 6.32,
    "offset": 739.36,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "are you okay? I called you 10 times.",
    "duration": 6.48,
    "offset": 742.24,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; My phone is dead, Ethan. I didn&#39;t check",
    "duration": 5.36,
    "offset": 745.68,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "anything.",
    "duration": 4.72,
    "offset": 748.72,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Did you survive without it?",
    "duration": 5.76,
    "offset": 751.04,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; I am fine, Ethan. Actually, I was",
    "duration": 6.8,
    "offset": 753.44,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "wonderful. I walked slowly. I tasted",
    "duration": 7.36,
    "offset": 756.8,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "real food and I really saw the world.",
    "duration": 4.719,
    "offset": 760.24,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Really?",
    "duration": 2.08,
    "offset": 764.16,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Yes.",
    "duration": 3.201,
    "offset": 764.959,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Disconnecting from the phone gave me a",
    "duration": 4.56,
    "offset": 766.24,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "chance to reconnect with myself.",
    "duration": 5.44,
    "offset": 768.16,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; That is a good lesson. No more phones",
    "duration": 5.92,
    "offset": 770.8,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "tonight. Just family time.",
    "duration": 7.52,
    "offset": 773.6,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; I love family time.",
    "duration": 6.559,
    "offset": 776.72,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; How about you? If you had one day",
    "duration": 4.24,
    "offset": 781.12,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "without your phone, what would you do?",
    "duration": 4.081,
    "offset": 783.279,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tell us in the comments.",
    "duration": 4.88,
    "offset": 785.36,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Please subscribe to our channel",
    "duration": 6.56,
    "offset": 787.36,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; and like share this video.",
    "duration": 8.599,
    "offset": 790.24,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "&gt;&gt; Goodbye. See you next time.",
    "duration": 4.919,
    "offset": 793.92,
    "lang": "en"
  }
]